su name translation_wordnet_sense_compound_config be map def
su text "format" ob text "translation-wordnet-sense-compound-refinery-v2" ya
su text "model" ob text "qwen3.5:9b" ya
su text "comparison-languages" ob text "chinese,french,russian,hindi" ya
su text "prompt-revision" ob text "sense-translation-composition-v1" ya
su text "max-output-tokens" ob num 1024 ya
su text "parallelism" ob num 8 ya
su text "max-senses-per-launch" ob num 64 ya
su text "verification-batch-size" ob num 32 ya
su text "candidate-revision" ob text "sense-head-advisory-v2" ya
su text "head-relation-policy" ob text "advisory" ya
prah
su name translation wordnet sense compounds be refinery def
su name select unresolved senses to name map sense worklist be translation stage do
su name translate missing sense definitions from name map sense worklist to name map sense translations be translation stage do
su name compose sense compounds from ve name map sense worklist name map sense translations to name map sense compound candidates be translation stage do
su name verify sense compounds from name map sense compound candidates to name map sense compound decisions be translation stage do
prah
